            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-2">
              <num>8</num>
              <heading>Subsection 84(1)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-2__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p><b><i>authorised nurse </i></b><b><i>prescriber</i></b> means an eligible nurse prescriber in relation to whom an approval is in force under <ref href="#sec-84A">section 84A</ref>AN.</p>
