              <content>
                <p>Omit “or the nurse practitioner treatment by an authorised nurse practitioner,”, substitute “the nurse practitioner treatment by an authorised nurse practitioner, or the nursing treatment by an authorised nurse prescriber,”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-21">
              <num>27</num>
