                <p>Omit “or 84AAL(2)(a) or (3)(a)”, substitute “, 84AAL(2)(a) or (3)(a) or 84AAQ(2)(a) or (3)(a)”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-22">
              <num>28</num>
              <heading>After paragraph 133(1)(bc)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-22__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-22__qstr-1__para-bd">
                  <num>bd</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>in the case of a defendant who is an authorised nurse prescriber—suspend:</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-22__qstr-1__para-i">
                  <num>i</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>the approval of that person under <ref href="#sec-84A">section 84A</ref>AN; or</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-22__qstr-1__para-ii">
                  <num>ii</num>
                  <content>
                    <p><role refersTo="#authority">the authority</role> to supply prescribed pharmaceutical benefits conferred upon that person by <ref href="#sec-93A">section 93A</ref>C; or</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-23">
              <num>29</num>
              <heading>Subsection 133(6)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>After “nurse practitioner”, insert “, a registered nurse”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-24">
              <num>30</num>
              <heading>Subsection 133(7)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-24__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p><b><i>authorised nurse pr</i></b><b><i>escriber</i></b> has the same meaning as in <ref href="#part-VII">Part VII</ref>.</p>
                </content>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-25">
              <num>31</num>
              <heading>After paragraph 134(1)(da)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-25__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p>or (e)	the approval of a person as an authorised nurse prescriber under <ref href="#sec-84A">section 84A</ref>AN is suspended or revoked;</p>
                </content>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-26">
              <num>32</num>
              <heading>After paragraph 134(4)(c)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-26__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-26__qstr-1__para-ca">
                  <num>ca</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>an approval of a person as an authorised nurse prescriber under <ref href="#sec-84A">section 84A</ref>AN;</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-27">
              <num>33</num>
              <heading>At the end of subsection 134(4)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Add:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-27__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <content>
                  <p>; or (f)	an authority conferred upon an authorised nurse prescriber by <ref href="#sec-93A">section 93A</ref>C.</p>
                </content>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-28">
              <num>34</num>
              <heading>Paragraph 135A(6)(gb)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “nurse practitioners, or the authorisation (however described) of persons to practise as nurse practitioners”, substitute “registered nurses or nurse practitioners, or the authorisation (however described) of persons to practise as registered nurses or nurse practitioners”.</p>
              </content>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-29">
              <num>35</num>
              <heading>After paragraph 139A(1)(dd)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Insert:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-29__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-29__qstr-1__para-dda">
                  <num>dda</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>a person was or was not an authorised nurse prescriber under <ref href="#sec-84A">section 84A</ref>AN;</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
              </quotedStructure>
            </hcontainer>
            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-2__item-30">
              <num>36</num>
              <heading>Paragraph 139A(1)(de)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Omit “or 93AB”, substitute “, 93AB or 93AC”.</p>
                <p>[<i>Minister’s second reading speech made in—</i></p>
                <p><i>House of Representatives on 26 November 2025</i></p>
